<title>UK: BOE sets 5-31/32 pct rate on UK money market repos.</title>
<headline>BOE sets 5-31/32 pct rate on UK money market repos.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England set an unchanged rate of 5-31/32 percent on repos and secured loan facilities starting on Thursday.</p>
<p>Maturity dates are February 20, 21 and 24 for the two-week option and March 6, 7 and 10 for the four-week option.</p>
<p>The Bank will announce the amounts to be allotted in the repos at around 1310 GMT.</p>
</text>
